<title>USA: Cybex Intl names executives.</title>
<headline>Cybex Intl names executives.</headline>
<dateline>MEDWAY, Mass. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cybex International Inc said Tuesday that it has named Peter Haines president and chief executive officer and William Hurley chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Haines was previously president and chief executive officer of Trotter Inc, which was recently merged with Cybex.</p>
<p>Hurley was chief financial officer of Trotter.</p>
<p>In December, Cybex said that Ray Elliott, president and chief executive of Cybex, would leave after the merger.</p>
<p>Cybex also said it has increased the size of the company's board of directors to nine from seven.</p>
<p>The board of directors of Cybex now includes four members designated by Cybex and five designated by Trotter.</p>
</text>
